From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:47:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] backends: let the shell draw the pointer into the picture

A filter that bends the picture has to bend the pointer with it, or the
pointer stops lining up with what it points at. That takes a software
cursor, which the debug control can already force, so let the shell ask
for it through the same count.

Upstream-Status: luft-only API for extension shaders
---
 src/backends/meta-backend-private.h | 6 ------
 src/meta/meta-backend.h             | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/backends/meta-backend-private.h b/src/backends/meta-backend-private.h
index 3512df64e1ed44d871d957246f2e82cddd2214ad..c4dbda6e2dad614d950ba9dfcd10a0ffd96de290 100644
--- a/src/backends/meta-backend-private.h
+++ b/src/backends/meta-backend-private.h
@@ -206,12 +206,6 @@ void meta_backend_add_hw_cursor_inhibitor (MetaBackend           *backend,
 void meta_backend_remove_hw_cursor_inhibitor (MetaBackend           *backend,
                                               MetaHwCursorInhibitor *inhibitor);
 
-META_EXPORT_TEST
-void meta_backend_inhibit_hw_cursor (MetaBackend *backend);
-
-META_EXPORT_TEST
-void meta_backend_uninhibit_hw_cursor (MetaBackend *backend);
-
 META_EXPORT_TEST
 gboolean meta_backend_is_hw_cursors_inhibited (MetaBackend *backend);
 
diff --git a/src/meta/meta-backend.h b/src/meta/meta-backend.h
index 827c21576466e8680e1a1f534c8c6129e9808b7a..026147caa5cf87929da16cfb69127ad8766eaf7c 100644
--- a/src/meta/meta-backend.h
+++ b/src/meta/meta-backend.h
@@ -62,6 +62,12 @@ MetaKeymapDescription * meta_backend_get_keymap_description (MetaBackend *backen
 META_EXPORT
 MetaContext * meta_backend_get_context (MetaBackend *backend);
 
+META_EXPORT
+void meta_backend_inhibit_hw_cursor (MetaBackend *backend);
+
+META_EXPORT
+void meta_backend_uninhibit_hw_cursor (MetaBackend *backend);
+
 META_EXPORT
 ClutterActor *meta_backend_get_stage (MetaBackend *backend);
 
